MLX
---

    Upstream:   https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx
    Copyright:  Copyright © 2023 Apple Inc.
    Licence:    MIT License
    Derived:    kernels/prim/gemm_traits.h
                kernels/prim/gemm_loader.h
                kernels/prim/gemm_mma.h
                kernels/prim/gemm_transforms.h
                kernels/linear/dequant.h
                kernels/linear/gemm.metal
                kernels/linear/qmv.metal
                kernels/linear/qmv_rows.metal
                kernels/linear/qmm_t.metal

The simdgroup-matrix GEMM tile (type traits, block loader, MMA, epilogue
transforms), the affine dequantize and quantized block loader, and the dense
and quantized matmul and matvec kernels built on them. Changed from upstream:

  * moved from `kernels/third_party/` into `kernels/prim/` and
    `kernels/linear/`, as `.h` headers;
  * the namespace `mlx::steel` renamed `pie::gemm`, the `STEEL_` and
    `MLX_MTL_` macros `PIE_`, the upstream-named helpers given Pie names;
  * the matmul and matvec kernels carry Pie's own entry points and forms
    (MXFP4, routed MoE tiles) beside the derived code.

A diff against upstream is the exact record of every change.
